#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:2
msgid "Modan2 Documentation"
msgstr "Modan2 문서"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:4
msgid "Welcome to Modan2's documentation!"
msgstr "Modan2 문서에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"Modan2 is a user-friendly desktop application that empowers researchers to "
"explore and understand shape variations through geometric morphometrics. It "
"streamlines the entire workflow from data acquisition (2D/3D) to statistical"
" analysis and visualization."
msgstr ""
"Modan2는 기하학적 형태분석을 통해 연구자들이 형태 변이를 탐색하고 이해할 수 있도록 돕는 사용자 친화적인 데스크톱 "
"애플리케이션입니다. 데이터 수집(2D/3D)부터 통계 분석 및 시각화에 이르는 전체 워크플로우를 간소화합니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:21
msgid "Features"
msgstr "주요 기능"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Hierarchical Data Management**: Organize data into nested datasets with a "
"clear structure"
msgstr "**계층적 데이터 관리**: 명확한 구조로 데이터를 중첩된 데이터셋으로 구성"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"**2D & 3D Visualization**: Integrated viewers for 2D images and 3D models "
"with landmark plotting"
msgstr "**2D 및 3D 시각화**: 랜드마크 플로팅을 포함한 2D 이미지 및 3D 모델용 통합 뷰어"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Semi-landmark Curves**: Trace curves on specimens and resample them into "
"evenly-spaced semi-landmarks, with edge-snapping (live-wire) auto-detection"
msgstr ""
"**준랜드마크 곡선**: 표본 위에 곡선을 추적하고 균등한 간격의 준랜드마크로 재표본화하며, 경계 스냅(라이브와이어) 자동 검출을 "
"지원합니다"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Statistical Analysis**: Perform Principal Component Analysis (PCA), "
"Canonical Variate Analysis (CVA), and MANOVA"
msgstr "**통계 분석**: 주성분 분석(PCA), 정준 판별 분석(CVA), 다변량 분산 분석(MANOVA) 수행"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Missing Landmark Support**: Advanced handling of incomplete landmark data "
"with shape-fitted visual estimation"
msgstr "**결측 랜드마크 지원**: 불완전한 랜드마크 데이터를 형상 정합 기반의 시각적 추정으로 고급 처리합니다"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Digitizing Aids**: Dataset-wide landmark names/descriptions and a \"Show "
"Expected\" guide that predicts remaining landmark positions"
msgstr ""
"**디지타이징 보조**: 데이터셋 전체에 적용되는 랜드마크 이름/설명과, 남은 랜드마크 위치를 예측해 주는 \"Show "
"Expected\" 안내 기능"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Data Import/Export**: Supports various file types (TPS, NTS, Morphologika,"
" CSV, OBJ, PLY, STL) plus a JSON+ZIP package format that bundles images and "
"3D models, all with drag-and-drop"
msgstr ""
"**데이터 가져오기/내보내기**: 다양한 파일 형식(TPS, NTS, Morphologika, CSV, OBJ, PLY, STL)과 "
"이미지·3D 모델을 함께 묶는 JSON+ZIP 패키지 형식을 지원하며, 모두 드래그 앤 드롭이 가능합니다"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Persistent Storage**: All data and analyses saved in a local SQLite "
"database managed by Peewee ORM"
msgstr "**영구 저장소**: 모든 데이터와 분석 결과는 Peewee ORM으로 관리되는 로컬 SQLite 데이터베이스에 저장"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:33
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "빠른 시작"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:36
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "설치"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"Download the latest version from the `releases page "
"<https://github.com/jikhanjung/Modan2/releases>`_. Package names carry the "
"version and build number."
msgstr ""
"`릴리스 페이지 <https://github.com/jikhanjung/Modan2/releases>`_ 에서 최신 버전을 내려받으세요."
" 패키지 이름에는 버전과 빌드 번호가 들어 있습니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:41
msgid "For Windows:"
msgstr "Windows:"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:42
msgid "Download the installer ZIP and run the installer inside it"
msgstr "설치 프로그램 ZIP을 내려받아 그 안의 설치 프로그램을 실행"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:44
msgid "For macOS:"
msgstr "macOS:"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:45
msgid "Download the DMG and drag ``Modan2.app`` to Applications"
msgstr "DMG를 내려받아 ``Modan2.app`` 을 응용 프로그램 폴더로 드래그"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:47
msgid "For Linux:"
msgstr "Linux:"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:48
msgid "Download the AppImage, make it executable, and run it"
msgstr "AppImage를 내려받아 실행 권한을 준 뒤 실행"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:50
msgid ""
"Only the Windows build is well tested; see :doc:`installation` for details."
msgstr "충분히 테스트된 것은 Windows 빌드뿐입니다. 자세한 내용은 :doc:`installation` 을 참조하세요."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:53
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr "기본 사용법"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:55
msgid "**Create a New Dataset**"
msgstr "**새 데이터셋 만들기**"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click \"New Dataset\" or press ``Ctrl+N`` to create a dataset for your "
"morphometric study."
msgstr "\"새 데이터셋\"을 클릭하거나 ``Ctrl+N`` 을 눌러 형태분석 연구용 데이터셋을 만드세요."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:59
msgid "**Import Objects**"
msgstr "**객체 가져오기**"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"Drag and drop 2D images or 3D models into your dataset, or use File → Import"
" to load landmark files (TPS, NTS)."
msgstr ""
"2D 이미지나 3D 모델을 데이터셋에 드래그 앤 드롭하거나, 파일 → 가져오기를 사용하여 랜드마크 파일(TPS, NTS)을 불러오세요."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:63
msgid "**Place Landmarks**"
msgstr "**랜드마크 배치**"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"Double-click an object to open the Object Dialog, then click on the "
"image/model to place landmarks."
msgstr "객체를 더블클릭하여 객체 대화상자를 열고, 이미지/모델을 클릭하여 랜드마크를 배치하세요."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:67
msgid "**Run Analysis**"
msgstr "**분석 실행**"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:69
msgid "Select your dataset and click \"Analyze Dataset\" to perform:"
msgstr "데이터셋을 선택하고 \"데이터셋 분석\"을 클릭하여 다음을 수행하세요:"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:71
msgid "Procrustes superimposition (aligns shapes)"
msgstr "Procrustes 중첩 (형태 정렬)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:72
msgid "Principal Component Analysis (PCA)"
msgstr "주성분 분석 (PCA)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:73
msgid "Canonical Variate Analysis (CVA)"
msgstr "정준 판별 분석 (CVA)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:74
msgid "MANOVA (multivariate analysis of variance)"
msgstr "다변량 분산 분석 (MANOVA)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:76
msgid "**Explore Results**"
msgstr "**결과 탐색**"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/index.rst:78
msgid ""
"View PC plots, shape variations, and statistical outputs in the Data "
"Exploration dialog."
msgstr "데이터 탐색 대화상자에서 PC 플롯, 형태 변이, 통계 출력을 확인하세요."

